#: scrnsave.cpp:100
msgid ""
"<h1>Screen Saver</h1> <p>This module allows you to enable and configure a "
"screen saver. Note that you can enable a screen saver even if you have power "
"saving features enabled for your display.</p> <p>Besides providing an "
"endless variety of entertainment and preventing monitor burn-in, a screen "
"saver also gives you a simple way to lock your display if you are going to "
"leave it unattended for a while. If you want the screen saver to lock the "
"session, make sure you enable the \"Require password\" feature of the screen "
"saver; if you do not, you can still explicitly lock the session using the "
"desktop's \"Lock Session\" action.</p>"
msgstr ""

#: scrnsave.cpp:133
msgid "Screen Saver"
msgstr "स्क्रीन सेवर"

#: scrnsave.cpp:146
msgid "Select the screen saver to use."
msgstr "उपयोग बर स्क्रीन सेवर चुनव"

#: scrnsave.cpp:150
msgid "&Setup..."
msgstr "सेटअप... (&S)"

#: scrnsave.cpp:154
msgid "Configure the screen saver's options, if any."
msgstr "यदि होही तहां स्क्रीन सेवर के विकल्प मन ल कान्फिगर करव."

#: scrnsave.cpp:156
msgid "&Test"
msgstr "जांच (&T)"

#: scrnsave.cpp:160
msgid "Show a full screen preview of the screen saver."
msgstr "स्क्रीन सेवर के पूरा स्क्रीन प्रिव्यू देखाव."

#: scrnsave.cpp:162
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "सेटिंग"

#: scrnsave.cpp:167
msgid "Start a&utomatically"
msgstr "अपने अपन चालू करव (&u)"

#: scrnsave.cpp:170
msgid "Automatically start the screen saver after a period of inactivity."
msgstr "स्क्रीन सेवर ल कुछ समय के निस्क्रियता के बाद् अपने अपन चालू करव."

#: scrnsave.cpp:178 scrnsave.cpp:211
msgid "After:"
msgstr "पस्चातः"

#: scrnsave.cpp:184
msgid " min"
msgstr "मि."

#: scrnsave.cpp:193
msgid "The period of inactivity after which the screen saver should start."
msgstr "इतने समय के निस्क्रियता के बाद् स्क्रीन सेवर अपने अपन चालू होही."

#: scrnsave.cpp:199
msgid "&Require password to stop"
msgstr "रोकने बर पासवर्ड के जरूरत होगी (&R)"

#: scrnsave.cpp:206
msgid ""
"Prevent potential unauthorized use by requiring a password to stop the "
"screen saver."
msgstr ""
"स्क्रीन सेवर ल रोकने बर पासवर्ड जरूरी करव जेखर से संभावित अवैधानिक उपयोग ल रोका जा सके."

#: scrnsave.cpp:214
msgid ""
"The amount of time, after the screen saver has started, to ask for the "
"unlock password."
msgstr "स्क्रीन सेवर के चालू हो जाय के उपरांत के समय जेखर बाद पासवर्ड बर पूछीस जाए."

#: scrnsave.cpp:219
msgid " sec"
msgstr "सेक."

#: scrnsave.cpp:237
msgid "Choose the period after which the display will be locked. "
msgstr "अवधि चुनव जेखर बाद् प्रदर्सक तालाबंद कर दे जाही."

#: scrnsave.cpp:242
msgid "Allow widgets on screen saver"
msgstr "स्क्रीन सेवर मं विजेट स्वीकारव"

#: scrnsave.cpp:244
msgid "Add widgets to your screensaver"
msgstr "अपन स्क्रीनसेवर मं विजेट मन ल जोड़व"

#: scrnsave.cpp:251
msgid "Setup..."
msgstr "सेटअप..."

#: scrnsave.cpp:267
msgid "A preview of the selected screen saver."
msgstr "चुने गे स्क्रीन सेवर के एक प्रिव्यू."

#: scrnsave.cpp:274
msgid "Advanced &Options"
msgstr "विस्तृत विकल्प (&O)"

